<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan says China using HK to squeeze its space.</title>
<headline>Taiwan says China using HK to squeeze its space.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan said on Thursday that communist China was trying to squeeze the Nationalist island by requiring all Hong Kong-Taiwan contacts be vetted by Beijing.</p>
<p>&quot;They are using Hong Kong to squeeze our space,&quot; Chang King-yuh, Taiwan's top China policymaker, told Reuters. &quot;How highly autonomous can Hong Kong really be in terms of commercial, trade, social and other non-political issues?&quot;</p>
</text>
